ed.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/03bfb976be5bcfef101645025f2ad637.poster.avif?t=1764265098\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/03bfb976be5bcfef101645025f2ad637.webm?t=1764265098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/03bfb976be5bcfef101645025f2ad637.mp4?t=1764265098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/e62ac0f8ec2de865c0632a02085c5f1d.poster.avif?t=1764265098\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/e62ac0f8ec2de865c0632a02085c5f1d.webm?t=1764265098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/e62ac0f8ec2de865c0632a02085c5f1d.mp4?t=1764265098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Horror Factor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to scare you and keep you on edge, either sneak your way through, or run as fast as you can. The monster can hear your microphone so be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/8286628ce7b8396f40e83a6fd3e1941d.poster.avif?t=1764265098\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/8286628ce7b8396f40e83a6fd3e1941d.webm?t=1764265098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305120/extras/8286628ce7b8396f40e83a6fd3e1941d.mp4?t=1764265098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles and Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange puzzles developed by an ancient race long gone, as well as some new technology that seems to be fused into what was once created here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.aka